<title>BRAZIL: Brazil gov't set to send 1997 budget to Congress.</title>
<headline>Brazil gov't set to send 1997 budget to Congress.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Planning Minister Antonio Kandir will submit to a draft copy of the 1997 federal budget to Congress on Thursday, a ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Congress is constitutionally obliged to approve the budget by the end of year but regularly fails to meet that requirement.</p>
</text>
